    <size=85%><color=#A0A8B4>Starts as Firefighter - VR controllers</color></size>


    <color=#3385F2><b>BLUE</b></color>
    - Player 2

    <size=85%><color=#A0A8B4>Starts as Driver - Logitech G29</color></size>


    Create
    or join a room here. Settings and READY are on your own station screen.'
